{
  "_readme": [
    "Canned responses for GET /api/v1/children/search, for building the Child Search UI without a live API.",
    "Every body below is exactly what the endpoint serializes: camelCase keys, `total` absent unless includeTotal=true.",
    "Each scenario names the query it answers. Wire them into MSW, json-server, or any stub that matches on query string.",
    "Photo and video URLs are placeholders - the real ones come from the WVI Horizon database and have not been sampled."
  ],

